This repository contains research code developed for the master's thesis
"Zvýšenie rozlíšenia a rekonštrukcia obrazu pomocou generatívnych neurónových sietí"
(Image Super-Resolution and Reconstruction Using Generative Neural Networks).


TensorLayer SRGAN Attribution

Parts of this repository are based on or adapted from the TensorLayer SRGAN
implementation:

https://github.com/tensorlayer/SRGAN

The upstream TensorLayer SRGAN repository states that its implementation is
provided for academic and non-commercial use only, and that commercial use
requires contacting the TensorLayer authors.

Any code in this repository derived from that project remains subject to the
applicable upstream terms.


ConvNeXt Attribution

This project incorporates architectural concepts from ConvNeXt:

Zhuang Liu, Hanzi Mao, Chao-Yuan Wu, Christoph Feichtenhofer,
Trevor Darrell, and Saining Xie,
"A ConvNet for the 2020s", CVPR 2022.

Official implementation:
https://github.com/facebookresearch/ConvNeXt

ConvNeXt is licensed under the MIT License.


